!Cubic_BaTiO3/run/manifest.example.yaml
!Cubic_BaTiO3/run/input/
!Cubic_BaTiO3/run/input/qnep_100k_template.in
!Cubic_BaTiO3/results/
!Cubic_BaTiO3/results/README.md
!Cubic_BaTiO3/results/compatibility_snapshot/
!Cubic_BaTiO3/results/compatibility_snapshot/**
